{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47511","headline":"七言 二十 · 吕岩","name":"七言 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫怪爱吟天上诗，盖缘吟得世间稀。\n惯餐玉帝宫中饭，曾着蓬莱洞里衣。\n马踏日轮红露卷，凤衔月角擘云飞。\n何时再控青丝辔，又掉金鞭入紫微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}